    "id": "standard-standardebooks-org-ebooks-j-storer-clouston-the-man-from-the-clouds",
    "title": "The Man from the Clouds",
    "deck": "J. Storer Clouston — During the First World War, a naval officer stranded on a Scottish island suspects it harbors enemy spies.",
    "source": "Standard Ebooks",
    "sourceId": "standard-ebooks",
    "sourceUrl": "https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/j-storer-clouston/the-man-from-the-clouds",
